// The PREVIEW site of Yaseen Docs on the phone (code name Notecard; YAZ-5087; decision 8, round 10 item 16, round 12
// item 14): Cloudflare Workers static assets, published by hand with `npm run mobile:publish:preview`
// (mobile/README.md, "How to publish").
// Static files only: no Worker script (`main`), no binding, no workers.dev address, no logs. The token never reaches it
// (decision 13). YAZ-5579: the real address, docs.yaseenarshad.com, is a custom domain of this same Worker (Yaseen:
// "lets just do everything on the real address").
// YAZ-5476: two addresses of the SAME Worker. preview.docs.yaseenarshad.com is the new one; preview.notecard.yaseenarshad.com
// stays, because Yaseen's installed app and its data live there (phone storage belongs to the address) until he moves.
// The first route is the one `publish/keepPrevious.ts` reads the live build from: the old address, live since YAZ-5087.
{
  "name": "yaseen-notecards-preview",
  "account_id": "06ed69083fae875c626d37f9c05405a3",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-11-13",
  "workers_dev": false,
  "preview_urls": false,
  "routes": [
    { "pattern": "preview.notecard.yaseenarshad.com", "custom_domain": true },
    { "pattern": "preview.docs.yaseenarshad.com", "custom_domain": true },
    { "pattern": "docs.yaseenarshad.com", "custom_domain": true }
  ],
  "assets": { "directory": "./dist", "not_found_handling": "single-page-application", "html_handling": "auto-trailing-slash" }
}
